WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.030 --> 00:00:04.770
Greta your first climate strike was a
lonely event a little over a year ago

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:09.120
and in the intervening time you have
sparked the interest of millions

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:14.120
literally of children around the globe
demanding action for climate change

00:00:14.120 --> 00:00:27.269
what's your message to world leaders
today my message is that we'll be

00:00:27.269 --> 00:00:29.720
watching you

00:00:36.820 --> 00:00:44.989
this is all wrong I shouldn't be up here
I should be back in school on the other

00:00:44.989 --> 00:00:54.860
side of the ocean yet you all come to us
young people for hope how dare you you

00:00:54.860 --> 00:01:01.549
have stolen my dreams in my childhood
with your empty words yet I'm one of the

00:01:01.549 --> 00:01:07.600
lucky ones people are suffering people
are dying

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:14.569
entire ecosystems are collapsing we are
in the beginning of a mass extinction

00:01:14.569 --> 00:01:20.600
and all you can talk about is money
and fairytales of eternal economic

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:30.079
growth how dare you

00:01:30.380 --> 00:01:38.310
for more than 30 years the science has
been crystal-clear how dare you continue

00:01:38.310 --> 00:01:44.460
to look away and come here saying that
you're doing enough when the politics

00:01:44.460 --> 00:01:52.080
and solutions needed are still nowhere
in sight you say you hear us and that

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:59.490
you understand the urgency but no matter
how sad and angry I am I do not want to

00:01:59.490 --> 00:02:05.100
believe that because if you really
understood the situation and still kept

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:18.150
on failing to act then you would be evil
and that I refuse to believe the popular

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:24.690
idea of cutting our emissions in half in
10 years only gives us a 50% chance of

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:29.700
staying below 1.5 degrees and the risk
of setting of irreversible chain

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:36.890
reactions beyond human control 50% may
be acceptable to you

00:02:36.890 --> 00:02:43.800
but those numbers do not include tipping
points most feedback loops additional

00:02:43.800 --> 00:02:47.970
warming hidden by toxic air pollution or
the aspects of equity and climate

00:02:47.970 --> 00:02:54.959
justice they also rely on my generation
sucking hundreds of billions of tons of

00:02:54.959 --> 00:03:03.000
your co2 out of the air with
technologies that barely exist so a 50%

00:03:03.000 --> 00:03:09.739
risk is simply not acceptable to us we
who have to live with the consequences

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:15.959
to have 67 percent chance of staying
below a 1.5 degrees of global

00:03:15.959 --> 00:03:23.130
temperature rise the best odds given by
the IPCC the world had 420 gigatons of

00:03:23.130 --> 00:03:31.140
co2 left to emit back on January 1st
2018 today that figure is already down

00:03:31.140 --> 00:03:38.670
to less than 350 gigatons how dare you
pretend that this can be sold with just

00:03:38.670 --> 00:03:42.329
business as usual and some technical
solutions

00:03:42.329 --> 00:03:49.329
with today's emissions levels that
remaining co2 budgets will be entirely

00:03:49.329 --> 00:03:57.879
gone within less than eight and a half
years there will not be any solutions or

00:03:57.879 --> 00:04:02.829
plans presented in line with these
figures here today because these numbers

00:04:02.829 --> 00:04:08.200
are too uncomfortable and you are still
not mature enough to tell it like it is

00:04:08.200 --> 00:04:16.889
you are failing us but the young people
are starting to understand your betrayal

00:04:16.889 --> 00:04:24.490
the eyes of all future generations are
upon you and if you choose to fail us I

00:04:24.490 --> 00:04:29.099
say we will never forgive you

00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:41.000
we will not let you get away with this
right here right now is where we draw

00:04:41.000 --> 00:04:48.500
the line the world is waking up and
change is coming whether you like it or

00:04:48.500 --> 00:05:13.500
not thank you

00:05:13.500 --> 00:05:17.689
you

